<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sales at Napier and Christchurch was 444 NZ cents per kg clean versus 439 at last week's sale, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 870 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 534 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 388 vs 390</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 395 vs 403</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
